tps://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-12-01T02:32:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T08:43:21Z","closed_at":"2026-06-14T15:04:44Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot Engine v4.6.dev4.official.bd2ca13c6\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Vulkan 1.4.309 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Intel - Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics\n\n### Issue description\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13258e96-9edb-4112-b747-72d2225a18db\n\nI am encountering an issue on Windows when using a touch monitor with the \"Embed Subwindows\" option disabled. Buttons often require a double-tap to register a click.\n\nDetailed Description of the Problem\n1. First Touch: Only the mouse_entered signal is called. The button is effectively only focused, not clicked.\n\n2. Second Touch: When the user taps the same button again, the focus_entered and pressed signals are called, and the button action is executed.\n\nCritical Issue: Complete Unresponsiveness ⚠️\nFurthermore, there are cases where touch input is completely unresponsive to the initial tap. In these situations, the user must press and hold the screen for approximately 2 seconds to capture the focus before any subsequent single-taps will even register the double-tap sequence mentioned above.\n\nAttempts to Resolve (Troubleshooting)\n* Setting the Button's Focus Mode to None does not resolve the issue; the double-tap problem persists.\n\nWorking Condition (for comparison)\n* When the \"Embed Subwindows\" option is enabled (default setting), a single touch correctly triggers the pressed signal immediately.\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e11fffe7-bf8e-4b38-871a-a89c8ea1fa5c\n\nAdditional Context (Godot Editor Behavior)\nThis behavior is also observed within the Godot editor itself, as the editor is built with subwindows disabled (embed_subwindows = false). When using the editor on a touch-enabled device, all buttons, menu items, and UI elements require two taps to activate.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStart with a fresh Godot project (or the attached MRP).\n\nEnsure you are running Godot on a Windows machine connected to a touch monitor.\n\nIn Project Settings, navigate to Display > Window > Subwindows and disable the Embed Subwindows property.\n\nCreate a Window node and place a standard Button node inside it.\n\n(Optional but Recommended) Ensure the Button's Focus > Mode is set to None.\n\nRun the project (F5).\n\nAttempt to interact with the button using a single touch:\n\nObserved Behavior 1 (Double-Tap): The first touch only triggers the mouse_entered signal (setting focus), and the pressed signal is only triggered on the subsequent, second tap.\n\nObserved Behavior 2 (Complete Unresponsiveness): In some cases, the first tap does nothing. The user must press and hold (long press) for ~2 seconds to register the initial focus, after which the double-tap behavior (Observed Behavior 1) begins.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-subwindow.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23843975/test-subwindow.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"imdongye","id":42573050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42573050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye","html_url":"https://github.com/imdongye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113382/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":